# Rails Engine Architecture Standards

## Context
- Gutsphere is a Rails / hotwire native  platform that is an AI-Powered Gastrointestinal (GI) Health Copilot that does more than track symptoms—it helps  users discover triggers, gain real-time
insights, and feel in control every single day.
- All AI calls are made to langgraph-api

## Requirements



### App Structure
- Follows rails way structure
- Uses gem noticed for notifications which lives in app/notifiers
- Uses gem active_interaction for application-specific business logic which lives in app/interactions

